 353:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****   /**
 354:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****    * @brief Macros required for reciprocal calculation in Normalized LMS
 355:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****    */
